{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Policy - Application - Okta Application Access Denied by Sign-On Policy",
	"Description": "An application sign-on policy denied access. This is the policy working as intended, but a run of denials against one account or from one address is worth a look: it means something is repeatedly trying to reach an application it cannot satisfy the policy for.\n\nEvent type: application.policy.sign_on.deny_access\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/",
